Description: Support Hibiscus Glance and Watcher bootstrap
 Adapt the native upstream Apache service transitions and Glance staging
 setup while retaining the PR96 multinode bootstrap and Ceph backend.
 Isolate the bootstrap ordering fixture from host service commands.
 Unrelated Watcher Tempest microversion changes are intentionally excluded.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/canonical/regress-stack/commit/19eacd1f2b5bd38e17f7d2773aae7c4dbe3c39b1
